    <tr>
<![endif]--> <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  <td width="600" valign="top" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db-outlook-only" class="abe-column-block-outlook-only" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 15px;">
<![endif]-->
<div class="abe-column-block" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="">
<div class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db-padding" style="padding: 15px;">
<table style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;" role="presentation" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 70076746 - Implementation Guides for Entry Type 13 Test in ACE for U.S. Mail Processing (INT-057) and Mail Entry Type 13 Test (CBP-290) Moved from Draft to Current Chapters</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>U.S. Customs and Border Protection (CBP) implemented the Entry Type 13 (ET13) test through enhancements to the Automated Commercial Environment (ACE) on September 22, 2026. In support of this deployment, CBP moved the following ACE implementation guides from the &ldquo;Draft Chapters: Future Capabilities&rdquo; section of <a href="https://www.cbp.gov/trade/automated/catair" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CBP.gov</a> to the applicable sections for deployed functionality. </p>
<ul>
<li>Cargo Release implementation guides
<ul>
<li><a href="https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/ace-catair-cargo-release-chapter" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ACE CATAIR Cargo Release Chapter</a> to &ldquo;Chapters: Current Capabilities&rdquo;</li>
<li><a href="https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/pga-flag-enforcement-table" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PGA Flag Enforcement Table</a> to &ldquo;PGA Message Set Documents&rdquo;</li>
<li><a href="https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/stand-alone-filing-partner-government-agency-data-pe/px" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ACE CATAIR Stand-alone Filing for Prior Notice Data (PE/PX)</a> to &ldquo;PGA Message Set Documents&rdquo;</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Entry Summary implementation guides
<ul>
<li><a href="https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/ace-catair-entry-summary-create/update" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ACE CATAIR Entry Summary Create/Update</a> to &ldquo;Chapters: Current Capabilities&rdquo;</li>
<li><a href="https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/ace-catair-entry-summary-query" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ACE CATAIR Entry Summary Query</a> to &ldquo;Chapters: Current Capabilities&rdquo;</li>
<li><a href="https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/ace-catair-error-dictionary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ACE CATAIR Entry Summary Error Dictionary</a> to &ldquo;Supporting Documents&rdquo;</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p>To learn more about these deployments, refer to the <a href="https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/trade-information-notice-implementation-entry-type-13-test-ace-us-mail-processing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Implementation of Entry Type 13 Test in ACE for U.S. Mail Processing (INT-057/CBP-290) Trade Information Notice</a>.    </p>
<p>For questions about this deployment, contact the Cargo Release, Manifest and Export Product Division at <a href="mailto:CREM@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CREM@cbp.dhs.gov</a> or the Entry Summary, Accounts, and Revenue Division at <a href="mailto:ESAR@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ESAR@cbp.dhs.gov</a>. </p>
<p>For technical questions, contact your assigned Client Representative.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </td>
<![endif]--> <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>]]>
      </description>
    </item>
