<p><ul><li><a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USDHSCBP/2026/09/28/file_attachments/3796839/Section%20232%20PharmaHTSlist%20FINAL.docx'>Section 232 PharmaHTSlist FINAL.docx</a></li></ul></p>]]>
