<p><ul><li><a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USDHSCBP/2026/09/28/file_attachments/3795897/ANNEX-I-MOTOR-VEHICLES.pdf'>ANNEX-I-MOTOR-VEHICLES.pdf</a></li><li><a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USDHSCBP/2026/09/28/file_attachments/3795898/ANNEX-I-DAIRY.pdf'>ANNEX-I-DAIRY.pdf</a></li><li><a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USDHSCBP/2026/09/28/file_attachments/3795899/ANNEX-I-ALCOHOL.pdf'>ANNEX-I-ALCOHOL.pdf</a></li></ul></p>]]>
