<![endif]-->
<div class="abe-column-block" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="">
<div class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db-padding" style="padding: 15px;">
<table style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;" role="presentation" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 70015464 - Information: Quota Bulletin 26-305 2027 Specialty Sugar</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>Quota Bulletin 26-305 2027 Specialty Sugar has been published on our webpage: <a href="https://www.cbp.gov/trade/quota/bulletins/qb-26-305-2027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.cbp.gov/trade/quota/bulletins/qb-26-305-2027</a></p>
<p>Commodity:</p>
<p>Specialty Sugar as provided in the Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS), Chapter 17 and 21 subheadings, Additional United States Note (AUSN) 5.</p>
<p>Quota Periods:</p>
<p>October 1, 2026 - September 30, 2027</p>
<p>Opening Date:</p>
<p>Thursday, October 1, 2026, at 12:00 P.M. Eastern Time (ET)</p>
<p>This quota is expected to oversubscribe at Opening Moment.</p>
<p>The Trade may transmit the quota entry summaries in ACE on October 1, 2026, from 12:00 A.M. (midnight) local port time until 12:00 P.M. (noon) ET only. Entry summaries reported early (before 12:00 A.M. midnight local port time) or late (after 12:00 P.M. noon ET) will not be processed for the opening, however early transmissions may be retransmitted within the proper range of time.</p>
<p>Please immediately report transmission problems to the ACE Client Representative and the Quota and Agriculture Branch (QAB). Notification delays may result in exclusion from the opening. Entry summaries with transmission issues submitted late will be reviewed and handled by QAB on a case-by-case basis.</p>
<p>Questions regarding this message should be referred to Headquarters Quota and Agriculture Branch at <a href="mailto:HQQUOTA@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HQQUOTA@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </td>
<![endif]--> <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>]]>
      </description>
    </item>
