<div class="abe-column-block" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="">
<div class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db-padding" style="padding: 15px;">
<table style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;" role="presentation" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 70005765 - Electronic Export Manifest for Truck Cargo Test</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>U.S. Customs and Border Protection (CBP) is announcing a voluntary two-year test of the Automated Commercial Environment (ACE) Electronic Export Manifest (EEM) for Truck Cargo. The test evaluates the feasibility of requiring truck carriers to electronically submit limited export manifest data at least 24 hours prior to departure from the United States, followed by a complete export manifest filing no later than two (2) hours prior to arrival at the final port of export.</p>
<p>PARTICIPATION &amp; ELIGIBILITY:</p>
<ul>
<li>Participation is strictly limited to nine (9) truck carriers that meet all participant requirements as found in the general notice <a href="https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/09/23/2026-19414/electronic-export-manifest-for-truck-cargo-test" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.federalregister.gov/public-inspection/2026-19414/electronic-export-manifest-for-truck-cargo-test</a></li>
<li>Prospective participants must have the technical capability to electronically submit data via the ACE Export Truck Manifest Trade Portal or Electronic Data Interchange (EDI).</li>
</ul>
<p>APPLICATION PROCESS: Interested truck carriers should submit an email application to <a href="mailto:cbptruckexportmanifest@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cbptruckexportmanifest@cbp.dhs.gov</a> with the subject line: <em>&ldquo;Electronic Export Manifest for Truck Cargo Test Application</em>.&rdquo;</p>
<ul>
<li>The email must state the applicant's interest, confirm qualifications based on eligibility requirements, and provide a point of contact name and telephone number.</li>
</ul>
<p>FOR FURTHER INFORMATION CONTACT: Outbound Enforcement and Policy Branch, Office of Field Operations, CBP, via email at <a href="mailto:cbptruckexportmanifest@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cbptruckexportmanifest@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </td>
<![endif]--> <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>]]>
      </description>
    </item>
