<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 70003236 - Information: Quota Bulletin 26-231 Further Ensuring Affordable Beef Tranche 2</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>Quota Bulletin 26-231 Further Ensuring Affordable Beef Tranche 2 has been published on our webpage: <a href="https://www.cbp.gov/trade/quota/bulletins/qb-26-231-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Quota Bulletin 26-231 2026 Further Ensuring Affordable Beef for the American Consumer Tranche 2</a></p>
<p>Commodity:</p>
<p>Beef as provided in the Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS), Chapter 2 subheadings, Additional United States Note (AUSN) 3 and addressed in Presidential Proclamation and Annex &ldquo;Further Ensuring Affordable Beef for the American Consumer&rdquo; published on August 26: <a href="https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2026/08/further-ensuring-affordable-beef-for-the-american-consumer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2026/08/further-ensuring-affordable-beef-for-the-american-consumer/</a></p>
<p>Quota Period:</p>
<p>Expired Tranche 1: September 1, 2026 &ndash; September 30, 2026</p>
<p>Tranche 2: October 1, 2026 &ndash; October 30, 2026</p>
<p>Tranche 3: October 31, 2026 &ndash; November 30, 2026</p>
<p>Opening Date:</p>
<p>Thursday, October 1, 2026</p>
<p>All entries submitted after 12:01 a.m. local port time and prior to 8:30 a.m. Eastern Time (ET) and on the opening date will receive an entry time of 8:30 a.m. for quota qualification purposes. If the total for any HTSUS group exceeds the limit at 8:30 a.m. ET, all accepted entries will be prorated.</p>
<p>Questions regarding this message should be referred to Headquarters Quota and Agriculture Branch at <a href="mailto:HQQUOTA@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HQQUOTA@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
