<![endif]-->
<div class="abe-column-block" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="">
<div class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db-padding" style="padding: 15px;">
<table style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;" role="presentation" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 69990316 - MANDATORY: Complete Broker Continuing Education Requirements by January 31, 2027</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p><strong>Complete the mandatory 20 hours of Broker Continuing Education (CE) no later than January 31, 2027!</strong></p>
<p><strong>Don&rsquo;t wait for the deadline to certify CE credits or file the Triennial Status Report (TSR).</strong></p>
<p>Individually licensed brokers with an active license must certify completion of CE credits when they file the TSR. The TSR will be open mid-December 2026 through February 28, 2027. <strong>Please note your CE credits must be complete no later than January 31, 2027.</strong></p>
<p>Pursuant to 19 CFR 111.30(d) and 19 CFR 111.102, failure to satisfy these requirements will result in the revocation of your customs broker license. </p>
<p>For more information on CE, visit CBP&rsquo;s CE &amp; TSR Webpage: <a href="https://www.cbp.gov/trade/programs-administration/customs-brokers/customs-broker-triennial-status-report-tsr-and-continuing-education-ce-requirements" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.cbp.gov/trade/programs-administration/customs-brokers/customs-broker-triennial-status-report-tsr-and-continuing-education-ce-requirements</a>.</p>
<p><u><strong>CE Requirements</strong></u></p>
<p>Individual brokers are required to complete 20 hours of CE credits to maintain their license for the current triennial.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Credit Earning Period: January 1, 2025 &ndash; January 31, 2027.</strong></li>
<li><strong>Find Accredited Training:</strong> To ensure your credits count toward the 20-hour requirement, you must complete training provided by a CBP-selected accreditor or the federal government. Accredited training will have the CE logo visible.</li>
<li><strong>View Accredited Providers and Eligible Activities:</strong> <a href="https://www.cbp.gov/trade/programs-administration/customs-brokers/continuing-education" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.cbp.gov/trade/programs-administration/customs-brokers/continuing-education</a>.</li>
<li><strong>Documentation:</strong> Brokers must retain proof of CE completion (certificates, course codes, course names, dates, educators&rsquo; names, and/or transcripts) for at least three years for audit purposes.</li>
</ul>
<p><u><strong>TSR Requirements</strong></u></p>
<p>Filing the TSR requires that Individual brokers with an active license certify CE compliance, pay the triennial fee, and provide CBP with current contact information.</p>
<ul>
<li><b>Filing Window: Mid-December 2026 &ndash; February 28, 2027.</b> The precise portal opening date will be announced via CSMS 5-7 days prior to opening.</li>
<li><b>Requirement:</b> Filing of the status report and payment of the $100 triennial fee.</li>
<li><b>How to File:</b> All filings must be submitted electronically via <a href="https://e.cbp.dhs.gov/ecbp/#/main" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://e.cbp.dhs.gov/ecbp/#/main</a>.</li>
<li><b>Requirement Scope:</b> All brokers must file the TSR. Only individual brokers with active licenses must complete CE credits.</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
