<table style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;" role="presentation" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 69990151 - Harmonized System Update (HSU) 2622</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>Harmonized System Update (HSU) 2622 was created on August 31, 2026, and contains 16 harmonized tariff records and 93 Automated Broker Interface (ABI) records.</p>
<p>HSU 2622 contains the U.S. Department of Agriculture (USDA) Honey Board Assessment changes, and the new Affordable Beef Quota HTS updates per proclamation <a href="https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2026/08/further-ensuring-affordable-beef-for-the-american-consumer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">"Further Ensuring Affordable Beef for the American Consumer"</a>. For more information, please see <a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDHSCBP/bulletins/427af4f?reqfrom=share" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CAMS # 69709647</a>.</p>
<p>Questions or concerns with the USDA Honey Board Assessments should be directed to Kelley Werning at <a href="mailto:Kelly@nhb.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kelly@nhb.org</a>.</p>
<p>Questions or concerns with the new Affordable Beef Quota should be directed to Headquarters Quota and Agriculture Branch at <a href="mailto:HQQUOTA@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HQQUOTA@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
<p>Questions or concerns with this HSU should be directed to the HTS Administrator at <a href="mailto:HTSAdmin@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HTSAdmin@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
<p><span class="TextRun SCXW96501492 BCX8" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW96501492 BCX8">Related Message Number(s): CSMS # </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW96501492 BCX8">69709647</span></span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW96501492 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
