<table style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;" role="presentation" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 69941677 - CORRECTION: Update to ACE CATAIR Entry Summary Error Dictionary (V53)</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>This CSMS corrects <a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDHSCBP/bulletins/42ad25b" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CSMS 69915227</a> by updating the applicable Harmonized Tariff Schedule (HTS) number to be 9903.03.15.</p>
<p>Please be advised that an updated version of the <b>ACE CATAIR Error Dictionary V53</b> has been posted under the Supporting Documents: <b>Documentation for Entry Summary Chapters</b> section on <a href="https://www.cbp.gov/trade/automated/catair" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CBP.gov</a>.</p>
<p>This update includes the following error:</p>
<ul>
<li><b>F884 &ndash; EXEMPT HTS NOT ALLOWED FOR SECTION 338</b> </li>
</ul>
<p>Use of exemption HTS 9903.03.15 for S338 is not allowed because there is no appropriate dutiable CH99 HTS reported on the line.</p>
<p>This update was deployed to both the CERTIFICATION (CERT) and PRODUCTION (PROD) environments on August 26, 2026.</p>
<p>For any technical questions regarding this update, please contact your assigned Client Representative. </p>
<p>Questions or concerns should be directed to Entry Summary Accounts &amp; Revenue Division (ESAR) at <a href="mailto:esar@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">esar@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </td>
<![endif]--> <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
