<![endif]-->
<div class="abe-column-block" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="">
<div class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db-padding" style="padding: 15px;">
<table style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;" role="presentation" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 69915041 - Updates to ACE CATAIR Entry Summary Create/Update (v110 and v111)</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>Please be advised that an updated version of the <strong>ACE CATAIR Entry Summary Create/Update V110</strong> has been posted to the <strong>Chapters: Current Capabilities</strong> section on <a href="https://www.cbp.gov/trade/automated/catair" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CBP.gov</a>. This update includes the new FY27 Customs COBRA User Fees.</p>
<p>The adjusted fee amounts and limitations will be applied to importations effective October 1, 2026. The new amount will be in effect for a summary pre-filed prior to October 1, 2026, if the relevant entry date is on or after October 1, 2026.</p>
<p>The amounts are available in the Certification and Production environments.</p>
<p>An updated version of the <strong>ACE CATAIR Entry Summary Create/Update V111</strong> has been posted under the <strong>Draft Chapters: Future Capabilities</strong> section on <a href="https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/ace-catair-entry-summary-create/update-future-capabilities" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CBP.gov</a>.</p>
<p>The updates include: Ten new changes for Entry Type 13 added on July 24, 2026, and three new Input 23-Record requirements for Entry Type 13 added on September 8, 2026, in the Certification (CERT) environment. All updates are now available in CERT and scheduled to go to the Production (PROD) Environment on September 22, 2026.</p>
<p>For any technical questions regarding this update, please contact your assigned Client Representative. </p>
<p>Questions or concerns should be directed to Entry Summary Accounts &amp; Revenue Division (ESAR) at <a href="mailto:esar@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">esar@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </td>
<![endif]--> <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
