<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">As a reminder,&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">U.S. Customs and Border Protection&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">(CBP) will hold</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">&nbsp;the Pre-Deployment Support Call covering the upcoming enhancements to the Automated Commercial Environment (ACE) that will implement the new Entry Type 13 (ET 13) Test for processing international mail shipment (Implementation of Entry Type 13 Test in ACE for U.S. Mail Processing, INT-057, and Mail Entry Type 13 Test, CBP-290). To learn more about these deployments, refer to the&nbsp;</span></span><a href="https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/trade-information-notice-implementation-entry-type-13-test-ace-us-mail-processing" target="_blank" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: inherit;" rel="noopener"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #0563c1; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="none"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;" data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink">Information Notice</span></span></a><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
<div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #000000; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start;">
<p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: windowtext; text-align: left;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">The Pre-Deployment Support Call details are:</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #000000; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start;">
<ul style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: verdana;">
<li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="6" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">Date: Tuesday, September 15, 2026</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #000000; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start;">
<ul style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: verdana;">
<li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="6" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">Time: 1:00 p.m. ET</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #000000; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start;">
<ul style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: verdana;">
<li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="6" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">Join via Microsoft Teams Desktop or Mobile App here:</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/280534305714342?p=oVL4nNjrxDMfp4wsaJ" target="_blank" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: inherit;" rel="noopener"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #0563c1; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="none"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;" data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/280534305714342?p=oVL4nNjrxDMfp4wsaJ</span></span></a><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #000000; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start;">
<ul style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: verdana;">
<li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 72px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="o" data-font="Courier New" data-listid="6" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="2"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">Meeting ID: 280 534 305 714 342</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #000000; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start;">
<ul style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: verdana;">
<li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 72px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="o" data-font="Courier New" data-listid="6" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:1440,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Courier New&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[9675],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;o&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="2"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">Passcode: 7KP9SQ9t</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #000000; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start;">
<p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: windowtext; text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: windowtext; text-align: left;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">For questions about this deployment, contact the Cargo Release, Manifest and Export Product Division at CREM@cbp.dhs.gov or the Entry Summary, Accounts, and Revenue Division at<span>&nbsp;</span></span></span><a href="mailto:ESAR@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: inherit;" rel="noopener"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #0563c1; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="none"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;" data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink">ESAR@cbp.dhs.gov</span></span></a><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">.&nbsp;</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #000000; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start;">
<p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: windowtext; text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: windowtext; text-align: left;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">For technical questions, contact your assigned Client Representative.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #000000; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Segoe UI Web', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start;">
<p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: windowtext; text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: windowtext; text-align: left;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">Related Messages: CSMS #<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">69289734</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">,&nbsp;</span></span><i><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></i><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-contrast="auto"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">69761151</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, Calibri_EmbeddedFont, Calibri_MSFontService, sans-serif;" data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
</td>
</tr>
