<p><ul><li><a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/USDHSCBP/2026/09/11/file_attachments/3777938/Section%20338%20Canada%20Modified%20HTS%20LIST%20eff%20091526%20%28003%29%20Final.docx'>Section 338 Canada Modified HTS LIST eff 091526 (003) Final.docx</a></li></ul></p>]]>
