      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 10:00:16 -0400</pubDate>
      <title>CSMS # 69681205 - REMINDER: Still Time to Weigh in on ACE – Take the User Satisfaction Survey</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">69681205</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDHSCBP/bulletins/4274035</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
