<![endif]-->
<div class="abe-column-block" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="">
<div class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db-padding" style="padding: 15px;">
<table style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;" role="presentation" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 69681205 - REMINDER: Still Time to Weigh in on ACE &ndash; Take the User Satisfaction Survey</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/USDHSCBP/2026/08/14259679/screenshot-2026-08-28-091538_original.png" alt="Survey" title="null" width="501" height="170" /></p>
<p>Attention all ACE users - the 2026 ACE User Satisfaction Survey is now open, and CBP wants to hear from you! Fill out the satisfaction survey and let your voice be heard!</p>
<p>U.S. Customs and Border Protection (CBP) encourages all Automated Commercial Environment (ACE) trade community users to take this brief survey. <strong>The survey is voluntary and anonymous.</strong> Your response will help CBP understand users&rsquo; satisfaction with ACE, its capabilities and user experience. A high response rate will ensure more accurate representation across the trade community. The survey will remain open through 11:59 p.m. ET on September 11, 2026.</p>
<p>To access the survey, please click on the following link: <b><a href="https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/HVC9B8T" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/HVC9B8T</a></b></p>
<p><strong>Please note you may need to copy and paste the URL into your web browser.</strong></p>
<p><span class="TextRun SCXW144015199 BCX8" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW144015199 BCX8">Related Message Number(s): </span></span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW144015199 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{}"></span>CSMS # 69632351, CSMS # 69647683</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </td>
<![endif]--> <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>]]>
      </description>
    </item>
