<![endif]-->
<div class="abe-column-block" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="">
<div class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db-padding" style="padding: 15px;">
<table style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;" role="presentation" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 69726413 - Harmonized System Update (HSU) 2621</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>Harmonized System Update (HSU) 2621 was created on August 22, 2026, and contains 13 harmonized tariff records and 54 ABI records.</p>
<p><br />HSU 2621 contains the Section 338 updates. For more information, please see <a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/bulletins/gd/USDHSCBP-4261d04?wgt_ref=USDHSCBP_WIDGET_2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CSMS # 69606660</a>.</p>
<p>HSU 2621 also contains the following PGA HTS flagging updates for the Food Safety and Inspection Service (FSIS).</p>
<ul>
<li>FS3 flag added to HTS codes 2106909990, 2106909993, and 2106909994; and</li>
<li>FS4 flag updated to FS3 on HTS codes 0407210030, 0408110000, 0408190000, 0408910000, and 0408990000.</li>
</ul>
<p>Questions or concerns with the Section 338 updates should be directed to <a href="mailto:traderemedy@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">traderemedy@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
<p>Questions or concerns with the FSIS HTS flagging updates should be directed to <a href="mailto:itdssupport@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">itdssupport@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
<p>Questions or concerns with this HSU should be directed to the HTS Administrator at <a href="mailto:HTSAdmin@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HTSAdmin@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Related Message Number(s): <span style="font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif;">CSMS # 69606660</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
