<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 69726210 - Update to AESTIR Appendix C &ndash; ISO Country Codes</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>The Government of Nauru passed a constitutional amendment to change the name of the Republic of Nauru to the &ldquo;Republic of Naoero&rdquo;.</p>
<p><b>Automated Export System Trade Interface Requirements (AESTIR)</b> will be implementing the update to the Appendix C as listed above.</p>
<p>Documentation is available under the ACE AESTIR, Appendix C in the AES webpage which can be located at:<a href="https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/ace-aestir-appendix-commodity-filing-response-messages" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.cbp.gov/document/technical-documentation/ace-aestir-appendix-commodity-filing-response-messages</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </td>
<![endif]--> <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>]]>
      </description>
    </item>
