<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 69647683 - REMINDER: ACE User Satisfaction Survey &ndash; Your Input Matters!</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>Attention all ACE users - the 2026 ACE User Satisfaction Survey is now open, and CBP wants to hear from you! Fill out the satisfaction survey and let your voice be heard!</p>
<p>U.S. Customs and Border Protection (CBP) encourages all Automated Commercial Environment (ACE) trade community users to take this brief survey. <strong>The survey is voluntary and anonymous.</strong> Your response will help CBP understand users&rsquo; satisfaction with ACE, its capabilities and user experience. A high response rate will ensure more accurate representation across the trade community. The survey has been extended and will now remain open through 11:59 p.m. ET on September 11, 2026.</p>
<p>To access the survey, please click on the following link: <a href="https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/HVC9B8T" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/HVC9B8T</a></p>
<p><strong>Please note you may need to copy and paste the URL into your web browser.</strong></p>
<p><span class="TextRun SCXW261054092 BCX8" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW261054092 BCX8">Related Message Number(s):</span></span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW261054092 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span><span class="TextRun SCXW220329637 BCX8" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW220329637 BCX8">CSMS # 69632351</span></span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW220329637 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </td>
<![endif]--> <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </tr>
  </table>
<![endif]--></td>
