<table style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;" role="presentation" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 69567203 - Correction: Notice of Update to Drawback Error Dictionary Validations for FD07</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>CORRECTION: HTSUS classifications 9903.05.01 associated with Section 301 Duties on Certain Products from Brazil and 9903.05.20-9903.05.84 associated with Section 301 Forced Labor Import Duties <strong><u>are</u></strong> drawback eligible.</p>
<p>On August 12, 2026, CBP deployed updates to the validations for FD07 to disallow drawback for these HTSUS classifications. The validations for FD07 have been corrected in production to allow drawback for these HTSUS classifications and the Drawback Error Dictionary at <a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-1.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fwww.cbp.gov%252Ftrade%252Fautomated%252Fcatair%2F1%2F0100019d0276322c-3a095843-8328-4b4a-a47c-151fdc066996-000000%2FpI-tiJ5k9CJIiS6cgTcqEl76ZibCW2CykA6m8978RFE%3D449&amp;data=05%7C02%7Caltese.e.cabiness%40cbp.dhs.gov%7C78629490cb5144c2279208de852621e6%7Ce4b16b844c564f279af730345a161ad4%7C0%7C0%7C639094595983606644%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=XS10nJZpiFNQbKw2PFkuAFsmAE47hVZzqDLPs6LlalE%3D&amp;reserved=0" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ACE Automated Broker Interface (ABI) CBP and Trade Automated Interface Requirements (CATAIR)</a> has been updated, accordingly.</p>
<p>For questions, please contact <a href="mailto:OTDrawback@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OTDrawback@cbp.dhs.gov</a> or your Client Representative.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Related Message Number(s): 69302472, 69326983, 69535943&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
