      <title>CSMS # 69519766 - Updated Guidance #4: Implementation of Jones Act Waiver issued to the Department of War, dated March 17, 2026.</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">69519766</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDHSCBP/bulletins/424c996</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  <style type="text/css">
      table {border-collapse: collapse;}
  </style>
  <![endif]-->
<style type="text/css">
