<![endif]-->
<div class="abe-column-block" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="">
<div class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db-padding" style="padding: 15px;">
<table style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;" role="presentation" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 69498185 - Draft ACE Cargo Release CATAIR and Cargo Release Condition Codes Documents have been posted on CBP.gov</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>The Draft ACE Cargo Release CATAIR and Cargo Release Condition Codes documents have been posted to cbp.gov with the following changes pertaining to Entry Type 13. These changes are expected to be deployed to U.S. Customs and Border Protection (CBP) Automated Commercial Environment (ACE) Production environment on September 22, 2026.</p>
<p>Draft ACE Cargo Release CATAIR</p>
<ul>
<li>SE10 Notes 2, 7, 11, and 13 updated to reflect Entry Type 13 changes</li>
<li>SE15 Notes 7, 12, and 13 update to reflect Entry Type 13</li>
<li>SE30 Note 2 updated to reflect Entry Type 13</li>
<li>SE60 Note 3 updated to reflect Entry Type 13</li>
</ul>
<p>Cargo Release Condition Codes</p>
<ul>
<li>Error code changes pertaining to Entry Type 13
<ul>
<li>Error codes 253 and 331 were deleted</li>
<li>Error code 327 updates</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p>The Draft ACE Cargo Release CATAIR is available in the Draft Chapters: Future Capabilities section on cbp.gov.</p>
<p>Draft ACE Cargo Release CATAIR:</p>
<p><a href="https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/ace-cargo-release-implementation-guide-future-capabilities" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/ace-cargo-release-implementation-guide-future-capabilities</a></p>
<p>The Cargo Release Condition Codes document is available in the Supporting Documents section on cbp.gov.</p>
<p>Cargo Release Condition Codes:</p>
<p><a href="https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/cargo-release-condition-error-codes" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/cargo-release-condition-error-codes</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>For any technical questions regarding this update, please contact your assigned Client Representative.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Other questions regarding Cargo Control and Release should be directed to <a href="mailto:CREM@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CREM@cbp.dhs.gov</a>. For questions or concerns regarding Entry Summary, please email Entry Summary Accounts &amp; Revenue Division (ESAR) at <a href="mailto:esar@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">esar@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;"><span class="TextRun SCXW90211604 BCX8" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW90211604 BCX8">Related Message Number(s): </span></span>CSMS # 69289734, CSMS # 69298180</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
