<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>An updated <a href="https://www.cbp.gov/document/guidance/ace-development-and-deployment-schedule" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Automated Commercial Environment (ACE) Development and Deployment Schedule</a> is now available on CBP.gov. Please note that this is a notional schedule and subject to change.<br /><br />Visit <a href="https://www.cbp.gov/trade/automated" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CBP.gov/ACE</a> for the most up-to-date information on ACE Deployments.</p>
