    </item>
    <item>
      <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 09:15:11 -0400</pubDate>
      <title>CSMS # 69440156 - Final Reminder: Register for U.S. Customs and Border Protection’s August Trade Enforcement Webinars</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">69440156</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDHSCBP/bulletins/423929c</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
