</div>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;"><span class="TextRun SCXW222052251 BCX8" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW222052251 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="Strong">There will be ACE production standard invasive maintenance from 10:00 p.m. ET Saturday, August 8,<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW222052251 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="Strong">2026</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW222052251 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="Strong"><span>&nbsp;</span>to 4:00 a.m. ET Sunday, August 9, 2026.</span></span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW222052251 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></p>
