<![endif]-->
<div class="abe-column-block" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="">
<div class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-64e15064-a1f1-4d5b-9b3a-0a34fe1eb9db-padding" style="padding: 15px;">
<table style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;" role="presentation" border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
<h1 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-align: right; font-size: 18px; font-family: 'times new roman', times; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 120%;" align="right"><font size="5">Cargo Systems Messaging Service</font></h1>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<h2 style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 140%; font-family: 'times new roman', times; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">CSMS # 69440938 - Harmonized System Update (HSU) 2619</h2>
<div class="govd_hr">
<div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr /></div>
</div>
<p>Harmonized System Update (HSU) 2619 was created on August 1, 2026, and contains 6 harmonized tariff records and 25 ABI records.</p>
<p>HSU 2619 contains the Section 232 Pharmaceutical United Kingdom duty reduction from 10% to 0% for HTS 9903.04.63. For more information, please see <a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.federalregister.gov%2Fpublic-inspection%2F2026-15799%2Freduction-of-tariffs-patented-pharmaceuticals-and-pharmaceutical-ingredients-for-products-of-the&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctina.harrison%40cbp.dhs.gov%7C2f45a0c942e049d6f10708def15d0caf%7Ce4b16b844c564f279af730345a161ad4%7C0%7C0%7C639213579130743753%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=q6%2ByDHGafZzHesA%2FVtZeJ4XdE%2FbS7YztF41oS9WhBf0%3D&amp;reserved=0" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Federal Register Notice 2026-15799</a>.</p>
<p>HSU 2619 also contains PGA HTS flagging updates. The FDA tariff flag &ldquo;FD4&rdquo; was changed to &ldquo;FD3&rdquo; for the following two HTS numbers: HTS 2103.20.4020 (sauces and preparations therefore; mixed condiments and mixed seasonings; mustard flour and meal and prepared mustard: in containers holding less than 1.4 kg), and HTS 2103.90.9091 (sauces and preparations therefore; mixed condiments and mixed seasonings; mustard flour and meal and prepared mustard: Other, Other, Other). </p>
<p>The FDA tariff flag &ldquo;FD2&rdquo; was changed to &ldquo;FD1&rdquo; for HTS 8419.40.0010 (machinery, distilling or rectifying plant, rotary evaporator) and HTS 8419.40.0090 (machinery, distilling or rectifying plant, other). The FDA tariff flag &ldquo;FD1&rdquo; was changed to &ldquo;FD2&rdquo; for HTS 2941.90.5030 (Antibiotics, Other, Other, Clindamycin).</p>
<p>Questions or concerns with the Section 232 Pharmaceutical HTS updates should be directed to <a href="mailto:traderemedy@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">traderemedy@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
<p>Questions or concerns related to these PGA HTS flagging updates should be directed to <a href="mailto:imports@fda.hhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">imports@fda.hhs.gov</a> or <a href="mailto:itdssupport@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">itdssupport@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
<p>Questions or concerns with this HSU should be directed to the HTS Administrator at <a href="mailto:HTSAdmin@cbp.dhs.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HTSAdmin@cbp.dhs.gov</a>.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
  </td>
<![endif]--> <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>
